# MedSync Health, Inc.
# Remote Work Policy

## Philosophy

We believe in flexibility and trust our employees to work in the way that is most effective for them. We support a hybrid work model that allows employees to work from home or the office.

## Guidelines

- **Core Hours:** Employees are expected to be available during core hours (10 AM - 3 PM local time).
- **Communication:** Remote employees must maintain regular communication with their team via Slack, email, and video calls.
- **Equipment:** The company will provide necessary equipment for remote work, including a laptop and monitor.
- **Office Days:** Teams are encouraged to come into the office at least 1-2 days per week for collaboration.

## Approval

Remote work arrangements must be approved by the employee's manager.
